{local A is{if not steeringManager:enabled return true. if abs(steeringManager:angleError)>=.25 return false. return steeringManager:pitchPid:changeRate^2+steeringManager:yawPid:changeRate^2<constant:degToRad^2/16.},B is{if not steeringManager:enabled return true. if abs(steeringManager:angleError)>=steeringManager:rollControlAngleRange or abs(steeringManager:rollError)>=1 return false. return abs(steeringManager:rollPid:changeRate)<constant:degToRad.},C is{parameter Z is false. return A()and(not Z or B()).},D is{parameter Z is false. wait 0.wait until C(Z).}.export(lex("awaitSteering",D,"awaitRoll",{D(true).},"isSteeringSettled",A,"isRollSettled",B,"isSettled",C)).}